## 📋 **Presentation Day Checklist**

### **Before Building Preview:**

- [ ] All features working correctly
- [ ] Admin dashboard accessible
- [ ] User signup/login functioning
- [ ] Firebase integration stable
- [ ] UI polished and professional

### **After Building Preview:**

- [ ] Install and test APK on presentation device
- [ ] Test all major features
- [ ] Ensure admin button shows for admin users
- [ ] Verify app starts quickly and smoothly

### **During Presentation:**

- [ ] Demo core features (browse recipes, favorites, profile)
- [ ] Show admin dashboard for advanced functionality
- [ ] Highlight user management capabilities
- [ ] Demonstrate professional app quality

**Result: Professional presentation that showcases real app development skills!**
